---
// Import the CSS file from the same directory
import '../styling/style.css';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Tiam Hadjian</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<BaseLayout title="Home">
			<main class="main">
				<header>
					<h1>Hey, I'm Tiam!</h1>
					<h3 style="color: rgb(103, 100, 100); margin-top: 0.25rem;">Highschool Student, all- nerd.</h3>
				</header>

				<section>
					<h2 class="sub-heading">About me</h2>
					<div class="intro-text">
						<p>
							Quick introduction, Hi my name is <b>Tiam Hadjian</b> and I'm 15 years old.
							I've lived in <b>Germany</b> with my parents and little brother all my life, 
							but I'm 99% sure I'm 100% <b>Persian</b> or <b>Iranian</b> or whatever you 
							want to call it. <i>There's all my personal information, you creep.</i>
						</p>
						<p>
							I've played the <b>piano</b> since I was 8 and I love <b>coding</b> in my freetime.
							I also sometimes play around in <b>Blender</b>, which fun fact, is the only software
							where beginners manage to confuse the pros <i>(I don't know what I'm doing)</i>.
						</p>
						<p>
							I'm also a part of my school's robotics team <a href="https://github.com/Bento-Robotics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><b>Bento Robotics</b></a> <i>(sponsors are appreciated)</i> where we compete in the 
							RMRC (Rapidly Manufactured Robot Challenge) at the <b>RoboCup</b> <i>(Not to brag, but we have
							<b> won the German-Open</b> competition and came 8th at the World Championships).</i> We're
							also Open-Source, so if you were wondering, yes, you can steal our code.
						</p>
						<p>
							I've also recently picked up photography as a hobby after I found my dad's <b>Canon 1200D</b> 
							<i>(or Rebel T5 for all my freedom people)</i>. I'll link my insta here if I ever get to 
							making one <i>(I probably won't)</i>.
						</p>
						<p>
							Anyways enough about me and more about me. This website is dedicated to all of my <b>coding
							projects</b> and maybe some random <b>blogs</b> on the side.
						</p>
					</div>
					<h3 style="color: rgb(212, 212, 212); margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">(heavily inspired by <a href="https://www.taniarascia.com">Tania Rascia's</a> Website)</h3>
				</section>
			</main>
		</BaseLayout>
	</body>
</html>
